---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Button from '../../components/Button.astro';

const steps = [
  { num: '01', title: 'We take stock of where you are', detail: 'Where you stand, who your clients are, where they come from today, and what\'s holding you back. We look at facts, not guesses. That\'s our starting point.', time: 'The start' },
  { num: '02', title: 'We pick the right levers', detail: 'A site that brings you clients, your social channels, some outreach, a mini-CRM to track your prospects, your quotes and invoices. We take what you actually need, in the order that matters. Not everything at once.', time: 'Together' },
  { num: '03', title: 'We work in concrete actions, every week', detail: 'We set a regular check-in. I get hands-on, I work with you, we look at what comes in, we adjust. No pointless meetings, no slide decks. Concrete actions, and we move forward.', time: 'Every week' },
  { num: '04', title: 'You stay in control', detail: 'Everything is editable by you in your admin. I work with you, not instead of you. The goal is for you to walk away with clients coming in and the means to keep going on your own.', time: 'Your autonomy' },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="How I work with you | Marc M Method"
  description="No slide decks, no pointless meetings. We take stock, pick the right levers, and every week I roll up my sleeves with you to bring in clients. The right hand who gets hands-on: here's how we work together."
  lang="en"
  frPath="/methode"
  enPath="/en/method"
>

  <section class="w-full relative px-6 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24 overflow-hidden" style="background-color: #0D0D0D;">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle, white 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 40px 40px;"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-20 -left-32 w-96 h-96 rounded-full opacity-10 blur-3xl" style="background: #E86C47;"></div>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl relative z-10">
      <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4" style="color: #E86C47; letter-spacing: 0.2em;">How I work</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl mb-6 leading-tight">
        Action,<br/>
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#E86C47] to-[#F5C8B3] bg-clip-text text-transparent">not talk.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-neutral-400 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
        No slide decks, no pointless meetings. I work with you, every week, and we look at what comes in. Here's exactly how we work together to bring you clients.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- EDITORIAL: The mechanism, why it works -->
  <section class="w-full bg-[var(--color-bg)] px-6 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl">

      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-text)] font-medium mb-10">
        You don't need yet another consultant. You need someone who has already done it, who gets hands-on, and who moves forward with you every week.
      </p>

      <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mb-6">
        I've done it for real. 8 to 10 companies built, around twenty entrepreneurs helped. When we look at your situation, I speak from experience, not from theory read in a book. I know what it's like to chase clients with no one around to guide you.
      </p>

      <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mb-12">
        And I build the tools myself. The site, the outreach, the mini-CRM, the follow-ups. Most coaches talk without ever having run a business. Most developers code without ever having had to go find clients. I do both. That's rare, and it's exactly what changes everything when we work together.
      </p>

      <div class="border-l-4 pl-6 md:pl-8 mb-12" style="border-color: var(--color-accent);">
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-text)] italic">
          A consultant hands you a report, bills you, and leaves you to apply it alone. I do it with you. I build the site, I launch the outreach, we follow up with your prospects together. You're not left alone in front of an endless to-do list.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mb-6">
        We move forward in concrete actions. We do one, we look at the result, we keep what works, we drop what doesn't. Week after week, it adds up. No grand 12-month plan gathering dust. Real things, ready to apply Monday morning.
      </p>

      <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
        And in the end, you stay in control. Everything we build together, you can manage yourself: your site, your copy, your prospects. The point isn't for you to depend on me. The point is for you to have clients coming in and the means to keep going on your own.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STEPS -->
  <section class="w-full bg-white px-6 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-20 border-y" style="border-color: var(--color-border);">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--color-accent-text)] mb-3" style="letter-spacing: 0.2em;">The flow</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-2">4 steps, and we work continuously</h2>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mb-10 max-w-xl">Here's what actually happens, not the polished brochure version.</p>
      <div class="space-y-0">
        {steps.map((e, i) => (
          <div class="flex gap-6 pb-10 relative">
            {i < steps.length - 1 && <div class="absolute left-6 top-14 bottom-0 w-px bg-neutral-200"></div>}
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-white text-sm z-10" style="background-color: #E86C47;">{e.num}</div>
            <div class="pt-2.5">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-[var(--color-text)]">{e.title}</h3>
                <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400 bg-neutral-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">{e.time}</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)] text-sm leading-relaxed">{e.detail}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- LEVERS -->
  <section class="w-full px-6 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-20" style="background: #FAFAFA;">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-3">The levers we can activate</h2>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mb-8">We don't do it all at once. We take what you need, in the order that brings you clients fastest.</p>
      <div class="grid gap-0 sm:grid-cols-2">
        {[
          'A site that brings you clients, not just a showcase',
          'Your social channels, to get known',
          'Outreach, to go find clients yourself',
          'Knowing what to say, and to whom',
          'A mini-CRM to track your prospects without forgetting any',
          'Your quotes and invoices, to stop wasting time',
          'Your follow-ups, automated, so no prospect slips away',
          'Your bookings, taken online without back-and-forth',
          'Your visibility on Google and AI (ChatGPT, Perplexity, Claude)',
          'Your client reviews, put forward to build trust',
          'Everything tracked in numbers, so you know what works',
          'And you, staying in control of it all, in your admin',
        ].map(item => (
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3 border-b border-neutral-100">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" style="color: #E86C47;" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
            </svg>
            <span class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">{item}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- NOTE -->
  <section class="w-full bg-white px-6 py-10 md:px-8 md:py-12 border-t border-neutral-100">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl flex items-start gap-4">
      <span class="text-2xl flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">🤿</span>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed text-sm">
        I work 100% remote, from Metz, from wherever I am, sometimes between dives. I help independents in France and internationally. That's not a constraint, it's a freedom that benefits everyone: I choose who I work with, I move forward without distractions, and it shows in what I deliver.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="w-full relative px-6 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-20 overflow-hidden" style="background-color: #0D0D0D;">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-5" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle, white 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 32px 32px;"></div>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center relative z-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Shall we talk?</h2>
      <p class="text-neutral-400 mb-8">20 minutes, you tell me where you are, I tell you where to start. No strings attached.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
        <Button href="/en/contact/" variant="primary">Let's talk</Button>
        <Button href="/en/services/" variant="secondary">See the offer →</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
